      "id": "CVE-2026-105390",
      "publishedDate": "2026-10-13T22:44:38.433Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-10-13T22:44:38.433Z",
      "description": "Improper synchronization in the OpenVPN ovpn-dco-win for Windows versions 0.6.5 through 1.3.5 and 2.4.0 through 2.8.7 allows local attackers to trigger a deadlock via a crafted write to the ovpn-dco device, causing the host to become unresponsive.",
      "severity": "N/A",
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：OpenVPN ovpn-dco-win\n🔓 漏洞类型：CWE-413, CWE-833 (CWE-413, CWE-833)\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
